---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="RunnersHeart Support"
  description="Have questions or issues with RunnersHeart? Check the FAQ and contact information."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="support-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <nav class="locale-switch" aria-label="Language selector">
        <a href="/runners-heart/support/" class="locale-pill is-active">EN</a>
        <a href="/runners-heart/support/ko/" class="locale-pill">한국어</a>
      </nav>
      <h1>RunnersHeart Support</h1>
      <p class="intro">If you have questions, run into issues, or want to share feedback, start with the FAQ below or contact us directly.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary><span class="icon">▶</span><span class="question">Which devices are supported?</span></summary>
          <div class="answer"><p>RunnersHeart is designed for Apple Watch and iPhone. Exact supported devices and minimum OS requirements follow the current App Store listing for the latest release.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><span class="icon">▶</span><span class="question">Where is my heart rate and workout data stored?</span></summary>
          <div class="answer"><p>All workout data is stored <strong>on your device and in Apple HealthKit</strong>. RunnersHeart does not upload your running data to external servers.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><span class="icon">▶</span><span class="question">Do I need internet during a run?</span></summary>
          <div class="answer"><p><strong>No.</strong> The workout experience is designed to work offline while you run.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><span class="icon">▶</span><span class="question">Will it drain my battery?</span></summary>
          <div class="answer"><p>Heart rate sampling, GPS tracking, and haptic feedback are optimized for workout use. Battery use is comparable to other Apple Watch running apps.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><span class="icon">▶</span><span class="question">Can I back up or move my data?</span></summary>
          <div class="answer"><p>HealthKit data can be backed up through your Apple ecosystem. When applicable, iCloud and device restore flows preserve Health data according to Apple’s system behavior.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p class="contact-intro">For bug reports, support requests, or product feedback, email:</p>
      <div class="contact-card">
        <span class="label">Email</span>
        <a href="mailto:oozoofrog@gmail.com" class="email-link">oozoofrog@gmail.com</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="page-footer">
      <nav class="footer-links">
        <a href="/runners-heart/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator">•</span>
        <a href="/runners-heart/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .support-page {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header,
  details,
  .contact-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(150%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(150%);
  }

  .page-header {
    padding: 32px 24px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    background: var(--surface-bg);
  }

  .locale-switch {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .locale-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 36px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    color: #714855;
    border: 1px solid rgba(158, 49, 71, 0.08);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .locale-pill.is-active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9e3147, #bf4960);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .locale-pill:hover {
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    color: #9e3147;
  }

  .locale-pill.is-active:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    color: #3f1c27;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .intro {
    color: #5d4650;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .faq-section,
  .contact-section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    color: #3f1c27;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .faq-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  details {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
  }

  details[open] {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
  }

  summary {
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    color: #3f1c27;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .icon {
    color: #9e3147;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  details[open] .icon {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }

  .question {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .answer {
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eadfe2;
    color: #5d4650;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .answer p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    color: #5d4650;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .contact-card {
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74);
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .label {
    color: #9e3147;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .email-link {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #3f1c27;
  }

  .page-footer {
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .footer-links {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #9e3147;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 10px;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: #3f1c27;
  }

  .separator {
    margin: 0 8px;
    color: rgba(144, 112, 123, 0.7);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page-header {
      padding: 24px 18px;
    }

    .locale-switch {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
